00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:36.050
products.

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:39.260
Now, in case of
Verizon Media, when

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:41.750
you're dealing with this
many number of users

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:45.620
and generating over a
